        context_item("Activity 1 — Activity Synthesis", "• Display the story problem from Card D.\n• “Does this story problem have too much information\nor not enough?” (It has too much and not enough at\nthe same time.)\n• “What information do we need to solve the\nproblem?” (How many counters did Noah put in his\ncup?)\n• “What information is given that we might not need?”\n(3 of his counters were red and 7 were yellow.)\n• “Why might we not need this information?” (It will not\nhelp us find how many are still on his desk. The color\nwon’t change the number of counters. It would only\nmatter if he is playing Shake and Spill—Cover.)", line(203)),
