        context_item("Warm-up — Activity Synthesis", "• “Some of us used 7 + 8 to help with 15 - 7. What\nother subtraction expression does 7 + 8 help with?”\n(15 - 8. It’s like the other subtraction equation, you\njust have to find a different unknown addend.)", line(105)),
