        context_item("Activity 1 — Activity Synthesis", "• Invite students to share the correct diagram for the\nsecond problem.\n• Display the diagram.\n• Consider asking:\n◦ “How does the diagram match the story\nproblem?” (You can see that Mai’s rectangle is\nlonger and there is a question mark for Diego’s\npet.)\n◦ “How did you know which pet was shorter?” (It\nsaid that Mai’s snake was 17 cm longer, so\n\nDiego’s is shorter.)", line(222)),
