        context_item("Warm-up — Activity Synthesis", "• “Who can restate the pattern in different words?”\n\n• “Does anyone want to add an observation about why\n\nthat pattern is happening here?” (5 + 5 = 10, so\nwhen you count by 5 two times you make a new ten.)", line(108)),
