        context_item("Activity 1 — Activity Synthesis", "• Invite 2–3 previously identified groups to share\ncomparisons and their explanations.\n• “What do you notice about the numbers that are\nfarther to the right?” (They are greater. They\nrepresent a greater length from 0.)", line(215)),
