    [
        context_item("Warm-up — Activity Synthesis", "• “How could some of the patterns help you with\ncounting by these numbers?” (I know that the next\ncount by 5 should end in 5. I know that the next\ncount by 2 should have a 2 in the ones place.)\n\n• Consider asking:\n◦ “Who can restate the pattern in different words?”\n\n◦ “Does anyone want to add an observation on\n\nwhy that pattern is happening here?”\n\n◦ “Do you agree or disagree? Why?”", line(137)),
        context_item("Activity 1 — Activity Synthesis", "• Have students standing near each expression share\nhow they know their card matches the expression.\n\n• Consider asking:\n\n◦ “Where do you see each number in the\nexpression on your card?”", line(213)),
