        context_item("Activity 2 — Student Task Statement", "The bar graph shows\nhow many of the 4\ntypes of trees Clare saw\non the way home. Use\nthe graph to answer the\nquestions. Show your\nthinking using\nexpressions or\nequations.\n\n1. How many more pine trees did Clare see than\n\nfir trees?\n\n2. How many more pine trees did Clare see than\n\noak or maple trees?\n\n3. How many fewer oak trees did Clare see than\n\npine trees?\n\n4. How many fewer maple or oak trees did Clare\n\nsee than fir trees?", line(251)),
        context_item("Cool-down — Student Task Statement", "A group of students were asked, “Which is your favorite time to read?” Their responses are shown in this bar\ngraph:\n\nUse the graph to answer the questions.\n\n1. How many fewer students chose morning than afternoon? Show your thinking using expressions or\nequations.\n\n2. How many more students chose evening than morning or lunchtime? Show your thinking using expressions\nor equations.", line(374))
