        context_item("Activity 2 — Student Task Statement", "Write down a number between\n100 and 1,000 on your index\ncard. This is your mystery\nnumber.\nFold your index card in half so\nthat no one can see your mystery\nnumber.\nWrite 3 clues about your mystery number by\nfinishing these sentences:\n1. My mystery number is (odd or even) _____.\n2. My mystery number rounds to _____.\n3. My mystery number is between _____ and _____.\n\nPlay What’s My Number?\n\n1. Read the clues for your mystery number.\n2. Starting with the person on your right, have\nevery member in your team try to guess your\nmystery number and explain their reasoning.\n3. If they haven’t guessed the mystery number by\n\nthe time the last person shares, reveal the\nmystery number.\n4. Repeat Steps 1-3 with the next person in the\ngroup reading the clues for their mystery\nnumber.", line(261)),
