        context_item("Lesson Synthesis", "“Over the last few lessons we have been learning about division. We represented and solved two kinds of division\nproblems. Let’s summarize what we know about division together.”\n\n“What are some of the big ideas we have learned about division?” (Division is about equal groups. We can find how many\ngroups or how many there are in each group. We can represent division with drawings. We can write division\nexpressions to represent division situations.)", line(303))
