        context_item("Warm-up — Activity Synthesis", "• “What types of shapes do we see in all the different\npatterns?” (I see squares on the woman’s shirt. I see\ntriangles on the yellow fabric. I see circles in several\nof the patterns. I think I see rhombuses in the light\n\ngreen pattern at the bottom.)\n\n20 min\nPLC Activity\n\n’ve learned about quadrilaterals to design a wax print\nerals incorporated into the pattern. Then students design\nsquares and a quadrilateral that doesn’t belong to any", line(105)),
