        context_item("Warm-up — Activity Synthesis", "• “What equation can each diagram represent?” (The\narray represents 4 × 6 = 24 because there are 4\nrows of 6 dots, and there are 24 dots in the array.\nThe area diagram could represent 4 × 7 = 28 or\n28 ÷ 4 = 7 since the sides are 4 and 7, and the area\nis 28. The tape diagram could represent 24 ÷ 3 = ?\nor 3 × ? = 24 because we know the total is 24 and\n\nthere are 3 groups, but we don’t know how many are\nin each group.)", line(116)),
