    [
        context_item("Warm-up — Student Task Statement", "What do you know about 1 hour?", line(84)),
        context_item("Activity 1 — Student Task Statement", "The table shows how Mai spends the time she is\nawake on a school day.\n\nactivity         hours          minutes\n\nmorning\nroutine\n\ngetting to\nschool\n\ntime at\nschool\n\ngetting\n\nhome from\n\nschool\n\nhomework\nand reading\n\nplaying and\nfamily time\n\nbedtime\nroutine\n\n1. Complete the table to show how many minutes\nMai spends on each activity.\n\n2. How many hours does Mai spend at school?\nWhat is the time in minutes?\n\n3. How many minutes does Mai sleep on a school\nnight? Explain or show your reasoning.", line(137)),
