        context_item("Activity 2 — Student Task Statement", "Jada writes multiples of a mystery number. After\nwriting some numbers, she writes the number 126.\n\n• Mai says 6 is the mystery number.\n• Priya says 8 is the mystery number.\n\n• Andre says 9 could be the mystery number.\n1. Which student do you agree with? Show how\nyou know using equations.\n\n2. Jada gives one more clue: “If I keep writing\nmultiples, I’ll get to 153.”\n\nWhat is the mystery number? Explain or show\nyour reasoning.", line(272)),
