        context_item("Warm-up — Activity Synthesis", "• “What attributes of the figures did you pay attention\nto as you tried to find which 3 go together?\"\n\n• As students share, highlight the attributes on the\nimages that they are comparing.\n\n• If no students mention parallel sides as an attribute\n\nto consider, ask them about it.", line(112)),
