        context_item("Activity 1 — Activity Synthesis", "• Invite previously selected students to share\ntheir display.\n• “What arrangement does this group’s display\nrepresent? Why might they think this is the best\narrangement?” (3 rows of 10, stacked 2 containers\nhigh. They might think it's the best arrangement\nbecause it's long and narrow and not too tall, so it\nwould probably fit well on a cargo ship.)\n• “What can you tell this group that may make them\nchange their decision?” (It’s too tall and might start\nfalling in the water. It’s too wide and might not fit. It’s\ntoo wide and might not leave room for anything\nelse.)\n• Consider asking, “How much trash do you think is in\n\neach container?”", line(220)),
