        context_item("Lesson Synthesis", "“Today we described rectangular prisms and measured their volumes.”\n\nAsk a student who has not shared in previous activities to display a prism they built.\n\nAsk the class, “How can we find the volume of this rectangular prism?” (Find the number of unit cubes in a layer and\nmultiply that number by how many layers there are.)\n\n“How can we describe this rectangular prism so that our partner can build the same one?” (Describe the unit cubes in a\nlayer and the number of rows and layers.)\n\nMath Community\n\nAfter the Cool-down, give students 2–3 minutes to discuss any revisions to the “Doing Math” actions in small groups.\nShare ideas as a whole group, and record any revisions.", line(345))
