        context_item("Lesson Synthesis", "“Today we generalized some rules to compare products of fractions.”\n\n“What is your favorite way to compare products of fractions?” (I like to use the number line to help me visualize and\nthink of fractions as parts in a whole. I like to calculate and compare numbers. I like using the distributive property so I\ncan see if the product is greater than or less than one factor, without finding the value.)\n\nConsider asking students to write their response in their journal.", line(267))
