        context_item("Warm-up — Activity Synthesis", "• “Without finding the values, which product do you\nthink will be greater? Explain your reasoning.” (I think\n841 × 6 will be greater because 841 is a lot more\n\nthan 641. I think 641 × 8 will be greater because both\nproducts are 4,800 plus some 41s. 641 × 8 has more\n41s than 841 × 6.)\n• “We are going to revisit these problems in the Lesson\nSynthesis.”", line(98)),
