        context_item("Student Task Statement", "A school held several evening activities last month-a music concert, a basketball game, literacy night, and a drama play. The music concert was attended by 250 people.\n\n1. Attendance at the basketball game was 30% of attendance at the concert.\n2. Attendance at literacy night was 44% of attendance at the concert.\n3. Attendance at the drama play was 102% of attendance at the concert.\n\nHow many people came to each of these activities? Show your reasoning.", line(225)),
        context_item("Student Task Statement", "1. Three music artists plan to donate a percentage of the money they make from selling merchandise.\n\nComplete the tables to show how much each artist would donate for different amounts of merchandise sales.\n\n- a. Artist A plans to donate 1% of the amount of merchandise sales.\n- b. Artist B plans to donate 15% of the amount of merchandise sales.\n- c. Artist C plans to donate 67% of the amount of merchandise sales.\n2. Another artist plans to donate of the money made from selling merchandise. In the table, write an expression for the amount of donation for each sales amount.\n\n| sales ($)    | 1   | 40   | 100   | 3,200   |\n|--------------|-----|------|-------|---------|\n| donation ($) |     |      |       |         |\n\n| sales ($)    | 1   | 40   | 100   | 3,200   |\n|--------------|-----|------|-------|---------|\n| donation ($) |     |      |       |         |\n\n| sales ($)    | 1   | 40   | 100   | 3,200   |\n|--------------|-----|------|-------|---------|\n| donation ($) |     |      |       |         |\n\n| sales ($)    | 1   | 40   | 100   | 3,200   |\n|--------------|-----|------|-------|---------|\n| donation ($) |     |      |       |         |", line(391)),
        context_item("Student Task Statement", "Find each percentage. Explain or show your reasoning.\n\n1. 170% of 30\n2. 6% of 110", line(535))
