    [
        context_item("Student Task Statement", "Here is a tape diagram.\n\n\n\n1. Think of a situation with a question that the diagram can represent. Describe the situation and the question.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n2\n\n\n- 10 min\n\n2. Trade descriptions with your partner. Answer your partner's question.", line(108)),
        context_item("Student Task Statement", "For each question:\n\n- Draw a diagram that represents the situation.\n- Write a multiplication equation and a division equation that represent the situation.\n- Answer the question.\n1. To make 4 batches of pink paint, 6 teaspoons of red paint are needed. How many teaspoons of red paint are needed for 1 batch?\n2. To make batch of play clay, cups of flour are needed. How many cups of flour are needed for 1 batch?\n3. Two tablespoons of cornstarch make batch of glue. How many tablespoons of cornstarch are needed to make 1 batch?", line(224)),
        context_item("Student Task Statement", "Here are three diagrams and three descriptions that represent situations about filling containers of water.\n\n\n\n- Tyler filled 2 equal-size bottles with 15 cups of water. How much water was in each bottle?\n- Kiran filled pitchers with 15 cups of water. How much water was in the full pitcher?\n- Priya needed 15 cups of water to fill pail. How much water is needed to fill 1 pail?\n1. Match each situation to a diagram. Be prepared to explain how you know.\n- a. Tyler:\n- b. Kiran:\n- c. Priya:\n\n\n\n\n2. Choose one situation. Write a multiplication equation and a division equation to represent the situation. Then answer the question.", line(424)),
        context_item("Student Task Statement", "Here are three diagrams and three descriptions that represent situations about sections of highways.\n\n\n\n- Priya's class has adopted two equal sections of a highway to keep clean. The combined length is of a mile. How long is each section?\n- Lin's class has also adopted some sections of a highway to keep clean. If sections are mile long, how long is each section?\n- A high school adopted a section of highway to keep clean. If of the section is mile long, how long is the section?\n1. Match each situation to a diagram. Be prepared to explain how you know.\n\n\n\n- a. Priya's class:\n- b. Lin's class:\n- c. High school:\n2. Choose one situation. Write a multiplication equation and a division equation to represent the situation. Then answer the question.", line(578)),
        context_item("Student Task Statement", "Answer each question, and show your reasoning.\n\n1. Kiran filled ice trays with water and made 24 ice cubes. How many ice cubes are in 1 ice tray?\n2. There are 24 people on a bus. They fill of the seats on the bus. How many seats are on the bus?", line(681))
