        context_item("Student Task Statement", "Your teacher will give you a set of cards. Take turns with your partner to match an equation with its solution.\n\n1. For each match that you find, explain to your partner how you know it's a match.\n2. For each match that your partner finds, listen carefully to their explanation. If you disagree, discuss your thinking and work to reach an agreement.\n3. After all the cards are matched, sort the matches into two categories based on operations.", line(241)),
        context_item("Student Task Statement", "Solve the equations in one column. Your partner will work on the other column.\n\nCheck in with your partner after you finish each row. Your answers in each row should be the same. If your answers aren't the same, work together to find the error and correct it.\n\n| column A   | column B   |\n|------------|------------|", line(335)),
        context_item("Student Task Statement", "```\nSolve each equation. Explain or show your reasoning.\n```\n\n$$1 . \\ x + 1 \\frac { 3 } { 4 } = 1 0$$\n\n$$3 . \\ \\frac { 1 } { 1 0 } x = \\frac { 2 } { 5 }$$\n\n$$\\begin{matrix} 1 . \\\\ 2 . \\\\ 3 . \\end{matrix}$$", line(429))
