        context_item("Student Task Statement", "1. Write the coordinates of each point.\n- Instructional Routines\n- MLR2: Collect and Display\n- 10 min\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3\n\n\n\n2. Answer these questions for each pair of points.\n- How are the coordinates the same? How are they different?\n- How far away are they from the -axis? To the left or to the right of it?\n- How far away are they from the -axis? Above or below it?\n- a. and\n- b. and\n- c. and\n3. Point has the same coordinates as point , except its -coordinate has the opposite sign.\n- a. Plot point in the coordinate plane, and label it with its coordinates.\n- b. How far away are and from the -axis?\n4. Point has the same coordinates as point , except its -coordinate has the opposite sign.\n- a. Plot point in the coordinate plane, and label it with its coordinates.\n- b. How far away are and from the -axis?\n5. Point has the same coordinates as point , except both coordinates have opposite signs. In which quadrant is point ?", line(171)),
        context_item("Student Task Statement", "1. Label each point with its coordinates.\n2. Find the distance between each pair of points.\n- a. Points and\n- b. Points and\n- c. Points and\n3. Which of the points are 5 units from ?\n4. Which of the points are 2 units from ?\n5. Plot a point that is both 2.5 units from and 9 units from . Label that point , and write down its coordinates.", line(304)),
        context_item("Student Task Statement", "Here are four points in a coordinate plane.\n\n1. What is the distance between points and ?\n2. What is the distance between points and ?\n3. Plot the point . Label it .\n4. Plot the point . Label it .", line(425))
