        context_item("Student Task Statement", "1. Find the unknown value in each equation.\n2. a.\n3. b.\n4. c.\n5. d.\n6. e.\n2. Rewrite each unknown factor problem (the last four equations of the previous problem) as a division problem.", line(193)),
        context_item("Student Task Statement", "- A water well drilling rig has dug to a height of -60 feet after 24 hours of continuous use.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n10 min\n\n\n\n6\n\n1. Assuming the rig drilled at a constant rate, what was the height of the drill after 15 hours?\n2. If the rig has been running constantly and is currently at a height of -147.5 feet, for how long has the rig been running?\n3. Use the coordinate grid to show the drill's progress.\n4. At this rate, how many hours will it take until the drill reaches -250 feet?", line(373)),
