        context_item("Student Task Statement", "1. Diego says that . Use the square to explain why 2.5 is not a very good approximation for .\n2. Find a point on the number line that is closer to . Draw a new square on the coordinate plane and use it to explain how you know the point you plotted is a good approximation for .", line(287)),
