        context_item("Activity 2 — Activity Synthesis", "• “Does your partner’s expression match their story\nproblem? What information in the story helps you\nfigure that out?” (Yes, in the story there were 5 red\napples and 2 green apples. That matches the\nexpression 5 + 2. I needed to know how many apples\nof each color there were.)\n• “When you were creating your story problem, was\nthere any information that you decided not to\ninclude? Why or why not?” (I didn't include the color\nof the jump rope because you didn't need that to\nfind how many times Lin jumped.)\n• As time allows, invite students to share the story\nproblems they created with the class.\n• As each student shares, consider asking:\n◦ “How does the story match the expression?”\n◦ “What information do we need to answer the\nquestion?”", line(260)),
