    [
        context_item("Warm-up — Activity Synthesis", "• “If you had to get snack for our class, what would you\nneed to know? What kind of questions would you ask\nto be able to get snack for our class?” (I would need\n\nto know how many people. I would need to know\nwhat kind of snack everyone wants.)", line(99)),
        context_item("Activity 1 — Activity Synthesis", "• “In the next activity, we will share our displays.”", line(159)),
        context_item("Activity 2 — Activity Synthesis", "• Choose one student’s display to share with the class.\nDo not show the display, but write an expression that\nshows how they packed the box. For example, if the\nstudent put 1 apple and 6 pears in their box, display\nand write 1 + 6.\n• “I wrote this expression about the box of fruit that\n_____ packed. What do we know about how _____\npacked the box?” (We know that they packed the box\nwith 2 kinds of fruit. We know that they put 1 of one\nkind of fruit and 6 of another kind of fruit. We know\nthat they put 7 fruits in the box altogether.)\n• “What questions do you still have about ______’s box?”\n(What kind of fruit did they put in the box? How\nmany of each fruit did they put in the box?)\n• Invite the previously identified student to share their\ndisplay. Ask students how the numbers in the\nexpression connect to the display.\n• Repeat with as many students as time allows.", line(204)),
        context_item("Lesson Synthesis", "“How did you choose to show how you would pack the fruit in the box? Did you use objects or draw a picture or do\nsomething else?” (I used connecting cubes. I drew a picture.)\n\n“If you used objects, how did the objects help you show how you would pack the box?” (I used objects, because I could\nshow the bananas using yellow connecting cubes and the apples using green connecting cubes.)\n\n“If you drew a picture, how did drawing a picture help you show how you would pack the box?” (I drew a picture, so I\ncould draw each fruit and write how many of each fruit would be in the box.)\n\n“If you did something else, how did it help you show how you would pack the box?”\n\nKindergarten                                    CC BY NC 2024", line(228))
    ],
    source('curriculum/im_teacher_guides/kindergarten/unit5/lesson15.md')).

