    [
        context_item("Warm-up — Activity Synthesis", "• Display Images A, C, and D.\n• “Why do these go together?” (They have squares and\nrhombuses.)\n\n• ”How are they different?\" (One has 7 shapes and the\nothers have 6. Two have 4 squares and the other has\n3 squares. Two are organized and one isn't.)", line(102)),
